<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  The 12 piece sprites are the atlas group "pieces", packed into assets/atlases/pieces.png. Each entry's <atlas><source> is the PNG it came from, written by
  Accept of the Generate panel from artgen/presets/chess_piece.json (assets/artgen/<Name>.png, with its <Name>.artgen.json beside it); the background is
  transparent (alpha 0), so the square under a piece shows through. The sources stay out of the web package.
  The entries are written by the packer, never by hand: Accept of a member in the Generate panel and the Texture editor's Pack repack the group, and so does
  the disabled test ChessPieceAtlasTest.DISABLED_RewriteTheShippedAtlas (config/CLAUDE.md). Only this comment is edited by hand.
-->
<root>
